SCOPE NOTE — read before redistributing
=======================================

The MIT licence below covers this repository EXCEPT the package
`packages/battleframe-simple-skirmish/`.

That package implements *Simple Fantasy Skirmish* by Peter Vodden, which is
published under Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 (CC BY-NC 4.0).
Non-Commercial means it **may not be sold**, and the MIT grant below explicitly
includes the right to "sell". The two cannot both apply to that package, so MIT
does not: see `packages/battleframe-simple-skirmish/NOTICE.md` for its terms and
the attribution that must travel with it.

No other package carries third-party licensed content. See
`docs/rules-content-audit.md` for what each package ships.

